{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-26","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["event-rogue-26"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-26-talk-403811940-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-26","missionId":"event-rogue-26","mission":"레오 (3)","scene":"레오 (3)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"모텔의 공용 욕실에서 또 한 번 레오와 마주친다. 하얀색 *천사* 후광이 달린 머리와 함께, 우윳빛 끈적한 액체의 몸에서 자라난 자그마한 촉수로 책 한 권을 든 채, 그가 당신을 향해 미소 짓는다","talkId":403811940,"textHash":"14689742109581510630","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:26/talk-403811940","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"98225b040d03221b","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-26-talk-403811941-line"],"bwikiPage":"里奥（其三）","bwikiRevision":58216,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9304","bwikiMission":"레오 (3)"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-26-talk-403811941-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-26","missionId":"event-rogue-26","mission":"레오 (3)","scene":"레오 (3)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"그런 다음 그가 기괴한 목소리로 행복 이론을 읊기 시작하자 주변의 객실 손님들이 창문 밖으로 머리를 내어 경청한다. 당신은 문득 그가 읊어주는 교리에 손님들 모두가 현혹되어 버린 것을 깨닫는다…","talkId":403811941,"textHash":"9293459897402372908","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:26/talk-403811941","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"98225b040d03221b","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"里奥（其三）","bwikiRevision":58216,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9304","bwikiMission":"레오 (3)"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-26-text-3313304563863883564-choice","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-26","missionId":"event-rogue-26","mission":"레오 (3)","scene":"레오 (3)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"귀찮은 두 *이웃*을 처치한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"3313304563863883564","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:26/text-3313304563863883564","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"0ff678ad7ea4dfd6","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"里奥（其三）","bwikiRevision":58216,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9304","bwikiMission":"레오 (3)"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-26-text-9551021475929807393-choice","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-26","missionId":"event-rogue-26","mission":"레오 (3)","scene":"레오 (3)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"살을 나오게 한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"9551021475929807393","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:26/text-9551021475929807393","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"3d0a4ed0ae75903a","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-26-text-13649226506890135443-effect"],"bwikiPage":"里奥（其三）","bwikiRevision":58216,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9304","bwikiMission":"레오 (3)"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-26-text-13649226506890135443-effect","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-26","missionId":"event-rogue-26","mission":"레오 (3)","scene":"레오 (3)","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"살과 레오의 인격을 초기화한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"13649226506890135443","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:26/text-13649226506890135443","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"3d0a4ed0ae75903a","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"里奥（其三）","bwikiRevision":58216,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9304","bwikiMission":"레오 (3)","bwikiReplyToIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-26-text-9551021475929807393-choice"]}],"orderNote":"공식 사건 도감에 귀속된 한국어 원문입니다. BWIKI에서 확인한 모드별 구간만 연결하며 조건·확률·미확인 경계는 이어 붙이지 않습니다.","bwikiBaseOrder":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-26-talk-403811940-line","gold-and-gears-event-rogue-26-talk-403811941-line","gold-and-gears-event-rogue-26-text-3313304563863883564-choice","gold-and-gears-event-rogue-26-text-9551021475929807393-choice","gold-and-gears-event-rogue-26-text-13649226506890135443-effect"],"bwiki":{"matchedRows":0,"cachedRows":5,"reviewRows":0,"segments":3,"reorderedRows":0},"retainedTextRowIds":[]}